# Controllers will be added in Step 2 (Auth) and Step 3 (Bookings).
# 
# Each controller handles the business logic for a specific resource:
#   authController.js      — register, login, logout, refresh token
#   bookingController.js   — create, read, update, cancel bookings
#   packageController.js   — list packages, availability, pricing
#   paymentController.js   — Stripe & Khalti payment flows
#   adminController.js     — admin-only operations
#   reviewController.js    — guest reviews & ratings
